1 NAME Erik Mikael /Fant/
2 GIVN Erik Mikael
2 SURN Fant
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 9 JAN 1754
2 ADDR
3 CITY Eskilstuna
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 OCT 1817
2 ADDR
