1 NAME Olof Tranaeus
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 DEC 1682
2 PLAC Tranegård
2 ADDR
3 STAE Värmland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 JAN 1751
