2 NOTE He was such a great grandpa, it was really hard for me when he passed away, I still miss him........
2 NOTE I love this photo...always have.... I know I have a copy somewhere... Kind of jealous (in a good way) that you have such great photos of Grandpa Jim...he looked like he really loved you. I was about eight when he died and he lived
3 CONC  in Oregon so I never really got to know him like everyone else, but I know that he loved you and cared for you from what I've been told... 
