2 NOTE HAPPY FATHERS DAY TO YOUR DAD, TIO JIM...I JUST LOOKED AT ALL THE PHOTOS, AND THERE WAS A PHOTO, B&W, OF DAD AND YOUR MOM WHEN THEY WERE BABIES...AND THEN IT HIT ME...THE LITTLE OLD LADY IN THE CENTER WAS CALLED "MAMAERE"...DOES T
